<title>SWEDEN: SWEDISH RIKSBANK PROBABLY SELLING MARK - TRADERS.</title>
<headline>SWEDISH RIKSBANK PROBABLY SELLING MARK - TRADERS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, probably sold marks on Friday as the crown weakened, Stockholm traders said.</p>
<p>One trader said central bank intervention had taken place. Other traders said they had not noted any direct central bank activity but said that the central bank often intervenes through just one commercial bank.</p>
</text>
